  message: "Pass 16 expansion/partial-correction: re-audit of all 15 hypergumbo subcommands shows the inconsistency is broader than I claimed. AAAAA said test-coverage/symbols/dead-code-maybe/search all support --format. INCORRECT: symbols has NO --format flag (text-only), search has NO --format flag (text-only). Verified --format supporters: config, test-coverage, dead-code-maybe (3 total). symbols, search, sketch, routes, explain, catalog, cache-status are all text-only (7 total). io-boundaries / verify-claims use --json. slice uses --flat. run / compact always emit JSON. Five different output conventions across 15 subcmds. Filed broader audit as QQQQQ (WI-pofas)."  # 5fe3
